[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0010","text":"哇……好厉害。\n这个，食用花卉蛋糕……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0020","text":"对吧！\n不只是好看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0030","text":"还特别好吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0040","text":"也就是说，最强……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0060","text":"今天的录制，\n虽然有点手忙脚乱的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0070","text":"ALSTROEMERIA也想这样，\n保持美丽又最强的状态。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0080","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0090","text":"但是，要变成那样的话\n需要什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0100","text":"好吃……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0110","text":"呵呵，是啊\n比如说──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0120","text":"练习唱歌跳舞，\n学会如何展现自己……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0130","text":"然后被放到漂亮的盘子上，\n能被别人推荐出去……大概就是这个意思吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0140","text":"有点困难呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0150","text":"嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0160","text":"但是……这个蛋糕……\n做起来，一定也很辛苦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0170","text":"只能加油了……！\n对吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0180","text":"打起精神来吧\n……去练习。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0190","text":"嗯，\n不变强可不行呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_04040000_05_0200","text":"嗯……！"}]
